#: monitorpageimpl.cpp:268
msgid ""
"<h1>Monitor Setup</h1>"
"<p>Please choose a monitor model from the list of vendors and models on the "
"right or specify a user defined model in the input fields below.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: monitorpageimpl.cpp:281
msgid "Illegal range for horizontal sync frequency."
msgstr "Onwettige omvang vir horisontaal sinkronisasie frekwensie."

#: monitorpageimpl.cpp:298
msgid "Illegal range for vertical refresh rate."
msgstr "Onwettige omvang vir vertikaal verfris tempo."

#: mousepageimpl.cpp:176
msgid ""
"<h1>Mouse Setup</h1>"
"<p>Please select the type, model and port of your pointer device from the "
"dropdown fields in the upper left. If your mouse does not have a third mouse "
"button you might want to enable the third button emulation in the lower "
"left. A 3rd button click is emulated by pressing both the first and second "
"mouse button.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Muis Opstelling</h1>"
"<p>Asseblief kies die tipe, model en poort van jou wyser toestel van die "
"oopskyf velde in die boonste links. As jou Muis doen nie het 'n derde Muis "
"knoppie jy dalk wil hê na aktiveer die derde knoppie emulering in die "
"sagter links. 'n 3de knoppie kliek is geëmuleerd deur gedruk beide die "
"eerste en tweede Muis knoppie.</p>"

